Methodology credit (knowledge-management skills, v0.6+):

The wiki / wiki-ingest / wiki-query / wiki-lint / wiki-fold / save /
autoresearch skill family implements the "LLM wiki" architectural
pattern proposed by Andrej Karpathy in a public gist:

  https://gist.github.com/karpathy/442a6bf555914893e9891c11519de94f

The pattern itself — LLM as continuous wiki maintainer over structured
markdown files (catalog index, append-only log, recent-context cache,
overview) — is an architectural idea documented publicly. The
implementation in this repo is original to obsidian-mcp-router, written
against the router's MCP tool surface; no source code was reused from
any prior implementation.

A prior independent implementation of the same pattern exists at
https://github.com/AgriciDaniel/claude-obsidian (MIT-licensed).
Conventions and slash command names overlap by necessity (both target
the Karpathy pattern), but no source code was reused.
